   "titulo": "Three forms of «poder»",
   "texto": [
    "**会** expresses a learned ability or something that will happen; **能** indicates capacity or possibility; **可以** expresses permission or possibility. In Spanish we often use «poder» for three, so look at the intention."
   ]
